# Keep the image tiny and secrets out of it.
.env
# The droplet's ~/swagino is a live git working copy (git clone + git pull) — exclude the repo
# metadata from the build context so a git-history dump never rides along in an image layer.
.git/
.github/
*.log
start_error.log
polish/
terminal-redesign/
terminal2/
tv-redesign/
.claude/
Main.dc.html
swagino-settings-glass.html
hidden.vbs
tray.ps1
start.bat
stop.bat
stop_proxy.ps1
*.md
